05. Malformed trailing path orderBy=address[city (no closing bracket) → 400
==========================================================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 197

{
  "detail": "malformed trailing path in orderBy term 'address[city' (§ 7.6.2.3)",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Invalid orderBy",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



